3. Third-party material — NOT covered by the above
--------------------------------------------------

Some material in this repository is not ours to license, and the CC BY-NC grant
above does not extend to it:

  * The Biology Meets Engineering logo, the robot bug mark, and the name and
    marks of the University of Cincinnati. These identify the programme and the
    university rather than forming part of the teaching material, so the licence
    above does not grant any right to use them. You are welcome to adapt the
    materials; please remove the logo from your version, so that it is clear the
    result is yours and not ours.

  * Screenshots of the mBlock software. mBlock, mBot and Makeblock are products
    and trademarks of Makeblock Co., Ltd. Screenshots are reproduced to document
    how to operate the software.

  * Photographs of Makeblock hardware not taken by the project.

  * "A Primer on fundamental types of animal spatial orientation and stimulus
    localization" and "Echolocation in Insectivores and Rodents" in
    `book/content/files/`, and any other third-party document reproduced there;
    rights remain with their respective authors and publishers.

  * Linked external material — YouTube videos, journal articles, manufacturer
    documentation — remains with its owners. Links are provided for reference
    only.

If you believe any material here infringes your rights, please get in touch and
we will remove or replace it.
